{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787357219359015704,"compiled_state":{"alias":"unanimated-detectible-cow","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"3894376d1703f7de662fe9e74d62bd506e72abfd7594d3d370f78ef21706742d","event_uuid":"c35aa5f9-5553-426f-8921-c8c9c4648d49","position":{"commit_sha":"9617c7ff2de4ad6bb132cce9af37fbb1982a8722","position":"1787354646844370001-c35aa5f9-5553-426f-8921-c8c9c4648d49"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"23c2449f00f66ceb9f90d34c1966a3ff7982d11df13caec0d3c5e7a34b94b9da","event_uuid":"c6f1c5de-cbac-4877-8942-abe5d06ced83","position":{"commit_sha":"cc01e2fd334e464644f95ad6ab09967e85295f23","position":"1787354667201429001-c6f1c5de-cbac-4877-8942-abe5d06ced83"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787354646844370001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c6f1c5de-cbac-4877-8942-abe5d06ced83","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8a0d-96ca-a60e-4da6"}],"description":"## Context\n\nDiscovered while adding the compact-worker leg to doctor's lock census (ticket\nbemused-painted-worm / 8a0d-96ca-a60e-4da6). Snapshot GC's operation-linked trigger\n(a3da2f4cce) added a stamped worker lock at `<snapshot-store>/gc/worker.lock`\n(`rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger._WORKER_LOCK_NAME`), the same detached-background-worker\nshape as `.rebar/compact-worker.lock` — a lock most likely to be held by a process an\noperator cannot find with `ps`.\n\n`doctor_locks.scan_locks` censuses only the tracker-adjacent locks (tickets write pair,\nhlc, enrich-drain, and now compact-worker). The snapshot store is a DIFFERENT root\n(`rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot.store_root()`, typically under the user cache dir, not the\nrepo's `.rebar/`), so adding this leg is not a one-line mirror: doctor would need to derive\nthe snapshot-store root, decide how to report a store that does not exist yet, and the lock's\nstaleness discipline (gc_trigger's own reclaim logic) may not be the shared\n`lock_owner.stamped_file_is_stale` table. That design question is why this is its own ticket\nrather than scope-creep on 8a0d-96ca.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Decide whether the snapshot-GC worker lock belongs in `rebar doctor`'s census (and if\n      so on which root/path derivation) or document why it is out of doctor's scope.\n- [ ] If added: the leg reports held-for / holder / staleness like the other stamped legs,\n      with tests for held (live + dead holder) and free/absent store.\n- [ ] If declined: the decision and rationale are recorded on this ticket and in\n      doctor_locks' module docstring.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2b09-d231-2152-42d6","ticket_type":"task","title":"doctor lock census has no snapshot-GC worker-lock leg","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c35aa5f9-5553-426f-8921-c8c9c4648d49","c6f1c5de-cbac-4877-8942-abe5d06ced83"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787357219359015704,"uuid":"f71b4603-4f34-4933-b6e2-b924b4b8d9cf"}